/Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>bTc2InBand</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Local><Local><Name>bTc3InBand</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Local></Method><Method><Name>RequestFaultReset</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ Operator reset. Only leaves Fault when latching faults have cleared.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>_FlowInBand</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>RequestDelivery</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>cmd</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>_IsSpaWarm</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>_FlowPercent</Name><ReturnType>REAL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>32</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>RequestStop</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ SES OFF / abort. Honored from any running or startup state.]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>RequestStart</Name><Comment><![CDATA[ SES ON. Honored only from SesOff (checked in the CASE).]]></Comment><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize></Method><Method><Name>RequestDpLoop</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>cmd</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Method><Name>RequestAutofill</Name><ReturnType>BOOL</ReturnType><ReturnBitSize>8</ReturnBitSize><Parameter><Name>cmd</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><BitSize>8</BitSize></Parameter></Method><Properties><Property><Name>PouType</Name><Value>FunctionBlock</Value></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>FB_WaterFill</Name><Comment><![CDATA[=============================================================================
 FB_WaterFill | VERIFIED 7.30.26 DA
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

 TWO modes selected by eMode:

   StartupFill
     - Open SV4 while the filtered CENTER switch (LS1) is dry.
     - The instant LS1 is covered, CLOSE SV4 and run a fixed confirm dwell
       (legacy T24 = 5 s). Valve does NOT keep filling during the dwell.
     - When the dwell completes -> bFillComplete.
     - If the fill-fault timer (legacy T10, preset tFillFaultTime) expires
       while LS1 is still dry -> bWaterFillFault (legacy B1600.15 -> S10).

   RunningAutofill
     - A self-contained PID holds level at the center switch (setpoint 25).
       Its output % is time-proportioned onto the on/off solenoid over
       tFillCycle (legacy T20 / V1516) -> metered trickle to replace boil-off.
     - Lower-duty floor: below rFillMinDuty (legacy 10%) the valve
       stays shut - no meaningless sub-threshold pulsing.
     - If the PID sits pinned at full output longer than tWaterFillCheck -> bWaterRegFault

 Switch filtering: raw center/empty switches debounced with
 symmetric on/off delays (tLevelFilter).

 Drives NO coil directly. Outputs qFillValve; FB_OutputHandler (single
 writer) maps it to GVL_IO

=============================================================================]]></Comment><BitSize>3072</BitSize><SubItem><Name>eMode</Name><Type>E_WaterFillMode</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ StartupFill | RunningAutofill | Idle]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>rSteamFlow</Name><Type>REAL</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bCenterSwitch</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ RAW LS1 center (X2). Filtered internally.]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>96</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bEmptySwitch</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ RAW LS3 empty  (X4). Filtered internally.]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>104</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bAutofillEnable</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ legacy X13 autofill-off signal]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>112</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Input</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>qFillValve</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ -> FB_OutputHandler -> SV4]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>120</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bFillComplete</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ startup fill done (LS1 covered + dwell)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>128</BitOffs><Properties><Property><Name>ItemType</Name><Value>Output</Value></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bCenterFiltered</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ exposed filtered LS1 (HMI / diagnostics)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize>