 ST_HmiStatus
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 EVERYTHING the RPi HMI displays, packed into ONE struct so pyads can
 refresh the whole UI with a single read:
     plc.read_by_name('GVL_HMI.stStatus', structure_def=ST_HMI_STATUS)

 Direction: PLC -> Pi only. The Pi must never write this struct.
 pack_mode 1: byte-aligned, no padding — pyads structure_def matches 1:1.
=============================================================================]]></Comment><BitSize>4672</BitSize><SubItem><Name>nPlcHeartbeat</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ increments every PLC cycle group; Pi checks it changes]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>0</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>nHmiHeartbeatEcho</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ last heartbeat value received from Pi (debug aid)]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><BitOffs>32</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bHmiOnline</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ PLC's view: Pi heartbeat is alive]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>64</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>eState</Name><Type>E_SystemState</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ current state (INT under the hood)]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>72</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>sStateName</Name><Type>STRING(31)</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ human-readable, e.g. 'SteamFlowing' (state pill)]]></Comment><BitSize>256</BitSize><BitOffs>88</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bReady</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ green Ready dot (temps in band, no faults)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>344</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bAlarmActive</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ red Alarm dot (any fault bit set)]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>352</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>nActiveFaults</Name><Type>UINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ count of active fault bits (Alarms page stat card)]]></Comment><BitSize>16</BitSize><BitOffs>360</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>stProcess</Name><Type>ST_ProcessValues</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ pressures, temps, flow, water level]]></Comment><BitSize>496</BitSize><BitOffs>376</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>bFillComplete</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ water fill complete]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><BitOffs>872</BitOffs></SubItem><SubItem><Name>rFlowPercent</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ rFlowActual / rFlowRated * 100 (bar graph)]]></Com