rting pressure for downstream sensor]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>1500</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">rP3AbsMax</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ max atmospheric pressure ]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>785</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">rP3AbsMin</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ min atmospheric pressure]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>575</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">rPtMaxVariance</Name><Type>REAL</Type><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>10</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">rMaxFlowDpRatio</Name><Type>REAL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ rated_flow(×10 SLM) × 0.001 = 250 × 0.001 = 0.25 SLM/Torr]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>0.25</Value></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">bEipSwapBytes</Name><Type>BOOL</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ confirm with the byte-order test below]]></Comment><BitSize>8</BitSize><Default><Bool>true</Bool></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">nSlaveId</Name><Type>UDINT</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ ID of Box 7: check the General tab and use its "Id"]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><Value>7</Value></Default></SubItem><Properties><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>GVL_HMI</Name><Comment><![CDATA[=============================================================================
 GVL_HMI
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
 The ONLY variables the RPi/pyads client touches. Three symbols, three jobs:

   GVL_HMI.stStatus           PLC -> Pi   read-only  (one bulk read per poll)
   GVL_HMI.stCommand          Pi -> PLC   buttons + heartbeat
   GVL_HMI.stSetpointRequest  Pi -> PLC   config values, applied via
                                          stCommand.bApplySetpoints

 Everything else in the PLC is off-limits to the HMI by convention.
 If the HMI needs a new value, add it to ST_HmiStatus — never let the
 Pi read internal FB state directly, or the interface contract rots.

 pyads access, e.g.:
   plc = pyads.Connection('5.x.x.x.1.1', 851)
   status = plc.read_by_name('GVL_HMI.stStatus', structure_def=HMI_STATUS_DEF)
   plc.write_by_name('GVL_HMI.stCommand.bSesOn', True)
=============================================================================]]></Comment><SubItem><Name Static="true">stHmiStatus</Name><Type>ST_HmiStatus</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ PLC -> Pi]]></Comment><BitSize>4672</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">stHmiCommand</Name><Type>ST_HmiCommand</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Pi -> PLC (FB_Hmi consumes+clears pulses)]]></Comment><BitSize>256</BitSize></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">stHmiSetpoints</Name><Type>ST_HmiSetpoints</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Pi -> PLC (applied on bApplySetpoints)]]></Comment><BitSize>184</BitSize><Properties><Property><Name>TcPersistent</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">T_HMI_HEARTBEAT_TIMEOUT</Name><Type>TIME</Type><Comment><![CDATA[ Pi poll rate is expected >= 1 Hz; comm loss declared after this timeout]]></Comment><BitSize>32</BitSize><Default><DateTime>T#5S</DateTime></Default></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">S_PLC_VERSION</Name><Type>STRING(31)</Type><BitSize>256</BitSize><Default><String>V 0.x</String></Default></SubItem><Properties><Property><Name>qualified_only</Name></Property></Properties></DataType><DataType><Name>LREAL_CONST</Name><SubItem><Name Static="true">DEFAULT</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>no_init</Name></Property><Property><Name>const_non_replaced</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">IGNORE</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>no_init</Name></Property><Property><Name>const_non_replaced</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">INVALID</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><Default><Value>0</Value></Default><Properties><Property><Name>no_init</Name></Property><Property><Name>const_non_replaced</Name></Property></Properties></SubItem><SubItem><Name Static="true">MAXIMUM</Name><Type>LREAL</Type><BitSize>64</BitSize><